{
  "name": "dsh-model-rotation",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "模型轮换兜底：模型请求在重试预算耗尽后或遇到额度用尽/429/soft_rate 等模型侧故障时，按预设的跨平台模型顺序循环切换继续；输入框内组件配置，列表可拖动排序并标识当前轮换模型，与模型选择列表联动。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.cjs",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.cjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
